WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling Archive Spire - Memory of First Light, tense.

2
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.300 align:center
Lyra: No! Not this one.

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.600 align:center
Lyra: Almost there. Hold!

4
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:10.900 align:center
Kael: It… slips…

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.200 align:center
Lyra: Got it! Mine.

6
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Archive Spire - Shard Nexus, desperate.

7
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:19.800 align:center
Lyra: Bridge crumbling. Faster!

8
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.100 align:center
Echo Shard: Release it. It is weak.

9
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.400 align:center
Lyra: Never! Not this.

10
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:25.700 align:center
Kael: A shield… it could…

11
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.000 align:center
Lyra: No. Can't lose it.

12
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:35.300 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Archive Spire - Edge of the Void, urgent.

13
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.600 align:center
Lyra: Too far. Too wide.

14
00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:39.900 align:center
Kael: A small one… a bridge…

15
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.200 align:center
Lyra: This? Just a fragment.

16
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.500 align:center
Lyra: Alright. Hold on.

17
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:44.800 align:center
Lyra: Now!

18
00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:51.100 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Shifting Memory-Maze - Echoes of a Lost Home, dread.

19
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.400 align:center
Lyra: Ground shifting. Where am I?

20
00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: You are nowhere. You are lost.

21
00:00:55.1000 --> 00:00:56.1000 align:center
Kael: Home… it was…

22
00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:58.300 align:center
Lyra: Focus! Not real.

23
00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:00.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: All is becoming us.

24
00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:06.900 align:center
♪ at dawn, in Dissolving Knowledge Vault - Memory of a Forgotten Skill, tense.

25
00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.200 align:center
Lyra: This structure… melting.

26
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.500 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Release it. It is useless.

27
00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:12.800 align:center
Lyra: A skill? I need it!

28
00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:14.100 align:center
Lyra: Almost… got it!

29
00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:15.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: A futile grasp.

30
00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:21.700 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in Fractured Path - Memory of a Childhood Promise, desperate.

31
00:01:21.1000 --> 00:01:23.1000 align:center
Lyra: Dead end! A trap!

32
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:25.300 align:center
Kael: Break it… small…

33
00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:26.600 align:center
Lyra: This promise? No!

34
00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:28.900 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: You cling to nothing.

35
00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:30.200 align:center
Lyra: Ah! Damn it!

36
00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:36.500 align:center
♪ in broad daylight, in The Loom's Chamber - Core Memory Nexus, dread.

37
00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:38.800 align:center
Lyra: Head… spinning. What is this?

38
00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:41.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We show you truth. Your insignificance.

39
00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:42.400 align:center
Kael: Familiar… the peace…

40
00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:43.700 align:center
Lyra: Kael! Help me!

41
00:01:43.1000 --> 00:01:45.1000 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: He remembers. He yields.

42
00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:51.300 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Corrupted Memory-Scape - Whispers of Purity, dread.

43
00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:53.600 align:center
Lyra: It… thinks it's right.

44
00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:55.900 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We purify. We protect what remains.

45
00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:58.200 align:center
Kael: No more pain… just… quiet…

46
00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:00.500 align:center
Lyra: You consume! You lie!

47
00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:03.800 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We preserve the essence. You cling to dross.

48
00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:10.100 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing Core - Memory of Self-Identity, desperate.

49
00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.400 align:center
Lyra: Walls closing! No way out!

50
00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:14.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your identity. It folds.

51
00:02:14.1000 --> 00:02:15.1000 align:center
Kael: Lost… already…

52
00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:18.300 align:center
Lyra: Not yet! Not me!

53
00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:19.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Yield. Be still.

54
00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:26.900 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Sacrificial Nexus - Memory of First Love, desperate.

55
00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:29.200 align:center
Lyra: No choice. It's this or nothing.

56
00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.500 align:center
Kael: The warmth… it was…

57
00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:33.800 align:center
Lyra: Forgive me. I have to.

58
00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:35.100 align:center
Lyra: Break! Now!

59
00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:36.400 align:center
Kael: Gone… forever…

60
00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:42.700 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in The Void's Edge - Revelation, dread.

61
00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:45.000 align:center
Lyra: Out. Safe. For now.

62
00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:48.300 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We see your sacrifice. We understand your heart.

63
00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:49.600 align:center
Lyra: What? How…

64
00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:55.900 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: You seek the truth of Kael. The one you held. We will be there.

65
00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:57.200 align:center
Lyra: No… They know.
